{"id":"745cac2b74e2ba56","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-thm-iterated-forcing-limit.md","title":"Iterated Forcing Limit","display":"thm-iterated-forcing-limit — Iterated Forcing Limit","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-iterated-forcing-limit","aliases":["58-thm-iterated-forcing-limit"],"display":"thm-iterated-forcing-limit — Iterated Forcing Limit","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-iterated-forcing-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-iterated-forcing-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-iterated-forcing-limit — Iterated Forcing Limit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"39a84ca5e5beaeb5\" href=\"?note=39a84ca5e5beaeb5\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" href=\"?note=cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md\">../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\vec P,\\vec Q,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit},P_\\delta\\in V\">\\(\\delta,\\vec P,\\vec Q,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit},P_\\delta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> is the imported exact iteration-system predicate; its <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Limit}\">\\(\\mathsf{Limit}\\)</span> argument is the chosen finite-, countable-, revised-countable-, or other support policy</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> and function restriction are imported from the displayed dependencies</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}limit}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S(\\vec P,\\vec Q,\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists P_\\delta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nP_\\delta=\\vec P(\\delta)\n\\land\\langle\\delta,\\vec P\\upharpoonright\\delta,\n\\vec Q\\upharpoonright\\delta,P_\\delta\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Limit}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}limit}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S(\\vec P,\\vec Q,\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists P_\\delta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nP_\\delta=\\vec P(\\delta)\n\\land\\langle\\delta,\\vec P\\upharpoonright\\delta,\n\\vec Q\\upharpoonright\\delta,P_\\delta\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Limit}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A limit stage depends on the support convention.  The canonical iteration system stores that convention in the explicit relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Limit}\">\\(\\mathsf{Limit}\\)</span> and requires the terminal stage to be related to the two restricted stage sequences.</li>\n<li>The former undeclared four-place iteration predicate and support-rule predicate have been replaced by the exact five-place upstream interface; no coordinatewise product is incorrectly substituted for a forcing iteration.</li>\n<li>Used in constructing models with controlled continuum.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"39a84ca5e5beaeb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md","status":"resolved","id":"cfb4df0f853ccdd7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta,\\vec P,\\vec Q,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit},P_\\delta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Limit}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}limit}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S(\\vec P,\\vec Q,\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\exists P_\\delta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nP_\\delta=\\vec P(\\delta)\n\\land\\langle\\delta,\\vec P\\upharpoonright\\delta,\n\\vec Q\\upharpoonright\\delta,P_\\delta\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Limit}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Limit}","display":false}],"bytes":1790,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-thm-iterated-forcing-limit.md|58-thm-iterated-forcing-limit]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["81cabbac7fa4d75d","39a84ca5e5beaeb5","cfb4df0f853ccdd7"]}